# v1.0.1 (S10.1) test notes pack: every feature on the pack's notes, plus
# the v1.0.1 pointer, Reverse scroll and label changes (Forma 1440x1920).
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
expect-open _test/test-00-start-here.md
expect Start here
tap-on Graph
expect-graph map
shot v1.0.1-test-notes-graph
tap-on Close
tap-on Options
shot v1.0.1-options-scroll
tap-on USB keyboard & mouse/Off
tap-on Scroll/Natural
expect-setting scroll=natural
tap-on Close
tap-on Help
tap-on USB keyboard, mouse & export
expect-help Help / USB keyboard, mouse & export
shot v1.0.1-help-usb-mouse
tap-on Close
# Pointer: circles over text, then idle hide (merged GL16 + cleanup).
pointer plug
pointer-to 700 500
wait 200
pointer-to 800 560
wait 200
pointer-to 760 640
wait 200
pointer-to 660 600
wait 200
expect-pointer visible
shot v1.0.1-pointer
wait 3100
expect-pointer hidden
shot v1.0.1-pointer-hidden
# Natural scroll in the long note.
tap-on Files
tap-on test-long-note.md
expect-open _test/test-long-note.md
wheel 2
shot v1.0.1-natural-scroll
pointer unplug
tap-on Options
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
shot v1.0.1-options-landscape
tap-on Orientation/Portrait
tap-on Close
